      <h2>Looking for a real course or provider?</h2>
      <p>Contact the school or training provider directly using contact details published on its official website. Confirm course availability, fees, schedule, prerequisites, location, and terms before enrolling.</p>
      <p>This test project does not provide referrals or verify third-party providers.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/locations/kozhikode/">Read the Kozhikode provider-comparison guide <span>↗</span></a>
    </section>
    <section class="content-section">
      <h2>Questions about this website</h2>
      <p>See the <a href="/faq/">FAQ</a> for the project’s scope and limitations, or visit <a href="/about/">About this website</a>.</p>
    </section>
  </main>
</PageFrame>
